opre che il compagno le nasconde l’esistenza del suo gemello monozigote Louis, che svolge la stessa professione in un altro quartiere di Parigi. Incuriosita decide di prendere un appuntamento con lui…. Un film in cui i temi più cari al regista, il desiderio, la seduzione, l’identità, l’inganno, il gioco tra realtà e fantasia si compongono in un torbido thriller al femminile.","language":"it-IT"},"tagline":{"value":"Deception is part of the attraction.","language":"en-US"},"releaseDate":"2017-05-26","status":"Released","rating":6.074,"ratingCount":599,"genres":["Romance","Thriller","Dramma"],"countries":["Belgium","France"],"facts":{"Runtime":"107m"},"keywords":[],"networks":[],"socialLinks":{},"cast":[{"id":1167459,"name":"Marine Vacth","role":"Chloé","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/uerTjXw6DWirxXTlZqNYxwHUZV7.jpg"},{"id":51325,"name":"Jérémie Renier","role":"Paul / Louis","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/3oBBshsyiBEh4PkR9YDMCl3iyp1.jpg"},{"id":14061,"name":"Jacqueline Bisset","role":"Mme Schenker / Chloé's Mother","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/oFAb5GVuP5mE2yEUZ6m70YiGIPw.jpg"},{"id":120571,"name":"Myriam Boyer","role":"Rose","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/rxVlSO2z2BvTqLf9kwZZI8HtBVM.jpg"},{"id":19363,"name":"Dominique Reymond","role":"Gynecologist / Agnès Wexler","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/7FFvvt6s1M0R0edQLA1hjaeNCXE.jpg"},{"id":2048838,"name":"Fanny Sage","role":"Sandra Schenker","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/7BaqexmwOE59ohS3VFhK9Tb0n2q.jpg"},{"id":1315535,"name":"Jean-Édouard Bodziak","role":"Young Psychoanalyst","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/fgpKi6IYAHl7fzCxysx4UzNArrg.jpg"},{"id":2048846,"name":"Antoine de La Morinerie","role":"Psychoanalyst 1","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/uxc3M4KTdXZvaxmMLk627DGuZws.jpg"},{"id":45447,"name":"Jean-Paul Muel","role":"Psychoanalyst 2","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/d0ZmvPaXCrLRvKwFD